                ),
            ),
            B.q("sa-m3-2", "sa-monitoring", "The team must see latency and packet loss between Azure VMs and an on-premises database server, with an alert when it gets worse. What do you recommend?", listOf("Connection monitor in Azure Network Watcher", "Application Insights availability tests", "Azure Service Health", "NSG flow logs"), setOf(0), "Connection monitor in Network Watcher checks connectivity between endpoints, such as Azure VMs and on-premises servers, on a schedule. It records latency and packet loss and can raise alerts when they cross a threshold.",
