            B.q("sa-m3-4", "sa-monitoring", "Security logs must stay searchable in the workspace for 90 days, then be kept cheaply for seven years and brought back for an occasional investigation. What do you recommend?", listOf("Set the tables' interactive retention to 90 days and total retention to seven years, using search jobs or restore when needed", "Set interactive retention to seven years", "Delete the logs after 90 days and rely on the activity log", "Export the logs to a VM disk"), setOf(0), "A Log Analytics table has interactive retention, when data can be queried normally, and total retention up to 12 years. Between the two the data is kept at low cost, and a search job or restore brings back what an investigation needs.",
