            B.q("sa-m3-6", "sa-identity", "Hybrid users must reset forgotten passwords from their phones, and the new password must work for on-premises sign-in too. What do you configure? Select two.", listOf("Self-service password reset in Microsoft Entra ID", "Password writeback through Microsoft Entra Connect or Cloud Sync", "A Conditional Access policy", "Pass-through authentication"), setOf(0, 1), "Self-service password reset lets users reset their own passwords after proving who they are. Password writeback sends the new password back to on-premises Active Directory, so both sign-ins use it.",
