            B.q("sa-m3-8", "sa-identity", "Staff must sign in to the company's own Android app with their Entra accounts, and the app must call the company's API on their behalf. What do you recommend?", listOf("Store each user's password in the app and send it to the API", "A shared API key compiled into the app", "Register the app and the API in Microsoft Entra ID, sign in with MSAL in the app, and have the API validate the access tokens", "Give each user a client secret"), setOf(2), "The app and the API are registered in Microsoft Entra ID. The Microsoft Authentication Library (MSAL) signs the user in on the phone and gets an access token for the API, which checks the token on each call. No passwords or keys live in the app.",
