            B.q("sa-m3-14", "sa-governance", "The security team must check settings inside the operating systems of Azure and on-premises servers, such as whether TLS 1.0 is disabled, and report compliance centrally. What do you recommend?", listOf("Azure Policy machine configuration, with Azure Arc for the on-premises servers", "Resource locks", "Network security groups", "The Azure activity log"), setOf(0), "Azure Policy's machine configuration, formerly guest configuration, checks settings inside a machine's operating system and reports them with the rest of policy compliance. Azure Arc brings on-premises servers under the same policies.",
                scenario = "Granby Bank's API servers for its Android banking app run partly in Azure and partly on-premises. Auditors want proof that old TLS versions are switched off on every server.",
                whyWrong = mapOf(
