            B.q("sa-m3-19", "sa-relational", "The security team wants alerts on suspected SQL injection and unusual access to the database, plus a regular scan for misconfigurations. What do you recommend?", listOf("Microsoft Defender for SQL", "Always Encrypted", "Transparent data encryption", "A firewall rule for the office IP"), setOf(0), "Microsoft Defender for SQL detects threats such as SQL injection and logins from unusual places, and its vulnerability assessment scans for misconfigurations and suggests fixes.",
                scenario = "Avonlea Travel's Android booking app talks to an Azure SQL database through an API. A penetration test found an injection flaw, now fixed, and the CISO wants to know about the next attempt.",
