            // Data integration
            B.q("sa-m3-27", "sa-data-integration", "A pipeline must start as soon as a partner drops a file into a storage container, rather than on a timer. What do you use in Azure Data Factory?", listOf("A schedule trigger every five minutes", "A storage event trigger", "A tumbling window trigger", "A manual trigger"), setOf(1), "A storage event trigger starts a pipeline when a blob is created or deleted in a chosen path, using Event Grid. The pipeline runs as soon as the file lands.",
