            B.q("sa-m3-36", "sa-backup-dr", "Hyper-V VMs in a small office without System Center must fail over to Azure if the office is lost, with minutes of data loss. What do you recommend?", listOf("Azure Site Recovery replicating the Hyper-V VMs to Azure", "Back up the VMs with MARS each night", "Copy the VHDs to Blob Storage weekly", "Azure Migrate one-time migration"), setOf(0), "Site Recovery replicates Hyper-V VMs to Azure continuously, with or without System Center Virtual Machine Manager. If the office is lost, you fail over and the VMs start in Azure with only minutes of data lost.",
                scenario = "Elmbridge Dental's two Hyper-V hosts run its appointment system, which the Android booking app uses. A flood warning made the owners ask for a real disaster recovery plan.",
                whyWrong = mapOf(
