            B.q("sa-m3-46", "sa-compute", "A tightly coupled engineering simulation needs hundreds of cores talking over a low-latency network, and the team wants to keep its Slurm scheduler. What do you recommend?", listOf("Azure CycleCloud managing a Slurm cluster on HPC VMs with InfiniBand", "Azure Functions", "Azure Container Apps", "Azure App Service"), setOf(0), "Tightly coupled jobs use MPI, a way for processes on many machines to exchange data constantly, so they need HPC VMs with InfiniBand networking. Azure CycleCloud creates and scales clusters with schedulers such as Slurm, so the team keeps its tools.",
