            B.q("sa-m3-51", "sa-app-architecture", "The web tier is scaling out to many instances, and users lose their shopping basket when a request lands on a different instance. What do you recommend?", listOf("Store session state in Azure Managed Redis", "Turn on session affinity and keep state in memory", "Store session state on each instance's local disk", "Use a single large instance"), setOf(0), "Keeping session state in a shared cache such as Azure Managed Redis means any instance can serve any request. The web tier becomes stateless and can scale out freely.",
