            B.q("sa-m3-54", "sa-migrations", "Twelve terabytes of images in Amazon S3 must be copied to Azure Blob Storage, server to server, without downloading them to a local machine first. What do you recommend?", listOf("AzCopy copying from the S3 bucket straight to Blob Storage", "Download to a laptop, then upload", "Azure Data Box", "Azure File Sync"), setOf(0), "AzCopy can copy objects from Amazon S3 directly into Azure Blob Storage. The data moves between the services, not through the machine running the command.",
