            B.q("sa-m3-55", "sa-migrations", "A SQL Server database must move to SQL Managed Instance by restoring the company's existing full and log backups from Blob Storage, keeping it in sync until cutover. What do you use?", listOf("Log Replay Service", "BACPAC import", "Transactional replication to Azure SQL Database", "Azure Data Box"), setOf(0), "Log Replay Service restores SQL Server full, differential and log backups from Blob Storage onto Managed Instance, applying new log backups as they arrive. At cutover the last log is applied and the database comes online.",
