            B.q("sa-m3-58", "sa-network-optimize", "Outbound traffic must be checked for known attack signatures, and the firewall must inspect encrypted HTTPS traffic as well. Which service and tier?", listOf("Azure Firewall Premium, with TLS inspection and IDPS", "Azure Firewall Basic", "A network security group", "Azure Firewall Standard"), setOf(0), "Azure Firewall Premium adds IDPS, an intrusion detection and prevention system that matches traffic against known attack signatures, and TLS inspection, which decrypts and checks HTTPS traffic. Standard and Basic cannot see inside encrypted traffic.",
